	"<div class=\"ui-cleanuppage\" data-skeleton=\"cleanup\" aria-busy=\"true\" aria-label=\"正在读取数据管理状态\">\n    <div class=\"ui-cleanupstats\">{{v0}}</div>\n    <div class=\"cleanupgrid\">\n      <div class=\"cleanupscraping\">{{v1}}</div>\n      <div class=\"cleanupmediarepair\">{{v2}}</div>\n      <section class=\"cleanupfieldset cleanuporganize\" data-geist-fieldset data-cleanup-task aria-labelledby=\"cleanup-loading-organize\">\n        <div class=\"geist-fieldset-content\"><h3 class=\"geist-fieldset-title\" id=\"cleanup-loading-organize\">整理</h3>\n          <p>按模板给文件改名并归入目录。先预览，确认后执行；执行过的一批可以整批退回。</p>\n          <div class=\"ui-organizefields\">\n            <div class=\"organizesource\"><span class=\"ui-gselect\"><span class=\"gselectfield organize-source-skeleton\">{{v3}}{{v4}}</span></span></div>\n            {{v5}}\n            {{v6}}\n            <div class=\"ui-organizepresets\">{{v7}}</div>\n            <p class=\"cleanupmeta\">{{v8}}</p>\n          </div></div>\n        <footer class=\"geist-fieldset-footer\" data-geist-fieldset-footer><button class=\"geist-button primary\" {{v9}}>预览</button></footer>\n      </section></div>\n    <section class=\"ui-resourcesync\" aria-labelledby=\"cleanup-loading-links\">\n      <h2 id=\"cleanup-loading-links\">链接管理</h2>\n      <div class=\"resourcesyncbox\" data-geist-fieldset data-cleanup-task data-fieldset-stack>\n        <div class=\"resourcesyncbody geist-fieldset-content\"><h3 class=\"geist-fieldset-title\">站外链接</h3>\n          <div class=\"linksummary\"><div class=\"ui-linkstats\"><div><span>链接总数</span><b>{{v10}}</b><small>{{v11}}</small></div>{{v12}}</div>\n          <div class=\"ui-linkhosts\"><span>主要站点</span><b>{{v13}}</b></div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"resourcesyncfooter geist-fieldset-footer\" data-geist-fieldset-footer><button class=\"resourceaction primary\" {{v14}}>{{v15}}<span>检查死链</span></button></div>\n      </div></section>\n    <section class=\"ui-resourcesync\" aria-labelledby=\"cleanup-loading-sync\">\n      <h2 id=\"cleanup-loading-sync\">资源同步</h2>\n      <div class=\"resourcesyncbox\" data-geist-fieldset data-cleanup-task>\n        <div class=\"resourcesyncbody geist-fieldset-content\"><h3 class=\"geist-fieldset-title\">文件与记录核对</h3>\n          <p>按馆藏记录逐条查找本地磁盘与网盘上的文件，列出文件已不存在的记录、空文件夹，以及不再被引用的缓存。</p></div>\n        <div class=\"resourcesyncfooter geist-fieldset-footer\" data-geist-fieldset-footer><button class=\"resourceaction primary\" {{v16}}>{{v17}}<span>检查文件</span></button></div>\n      </div></section></div>": "<div class=\"ui-cleanuppage\" data-skeleton=\"cleanup\" aria-busy=\"true\" aria-label=\"Loading data management status\">\n    <div class=\"ui-cleanupstats\">{{v0}}</div>\n    <div class=\"cleanupgrid\">\n      <div class=\"cleanupscraping\">{{v1}}</div>\n      <div class=\"cleanupmediarepair\">{{v2}}</div>\n      <section class=\"cleanupfieldset cleanuporganize\" data-geist-fieldset data-cleanup-task aria-labelledby=\"cleanup-loading-organize\">\n        <div class=\"geist-fieldset-content\"><h3 class=\"geist-fieldset-title\" id=\"cleanup-loading-organize\">Organize</h3>\n          <p>Rename files and sort them into directories using templates. Preview first, then confirm to apply. Each completed batch can be fully undone.</p>\n          <div class=\"ui-organizefields\">\n            <div class=\"organizesource\"><span class=\"ui-gselect\"><span class=\"gselectfield organize-source-skeleton\">{{v3}}{{v4}}</span></span></div>\n            {{v5}}\n            {{v6}}\n            <div class=\"ui-organizepresets\">{{v7}}</div>\n            <p class=\"cleanupmeta\">{{v8}}</p>\n          </div></div>\n        <footer class=\"geist-fieldset-footer\" data-geist-fieldset-footer><button class=\"geist-button primary\" {{v9}}>Preview</button></footer>\n      </section></div>\n    <section class=\"ui-resourcesync\" aria-labelledby=\"cleanup-loading-links\">\n      <h2 id=\"cleanup-loading-links\">Link management</h2>\n      <div class=\"resourcesyncbox\" data-geist-fieldset data-cleanup-task data-fieldset-stack>\n        <div class=\"resourcesyncbody geist-fieldset-content\"><h3 class=\"geist-fieldset-title\">External links</h3>\n          <div class=\"linksummary\"><div class=\"ui-linkstats\"><div><span>Total links</span><b>{{v10}}</b><small>{{v11}}</small></div>{{v12}}</div>\n          <div class=\"ui-linkhosts\"><span>Main sites</span><b>{{v13}}</b></div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"resourcesyncfooter geist-fieldset-footer\" data-geist-fieldset-footer><button class=\"resourceaction primary\" {{v14}}>{{v15}}<span>Check broken links</span></button></div>\n      </div></section>\n    <section class=\"ui-resourcesync\" aria-labelledby=\"cleanup-loading-sync\">\n      <h2 id=\"cleanup-loading-sync\">Resource sync</h2>\n      <div class=\"resourcesyncbox\" data-geist-fieldset data-cleanup-task>\n        <div class=\"resourcesyncbody geist-fieldset-content\"><h3 class=\"geist-fieldset-title\">File and record reconciliation</h3>\n          <p>Check each collection record against files on local and cloud drives. List records with missing files, empty folders, and caches no longer referenced.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"resourcesyncfooter geist-fieldset-footer\" data-geist-fieldset-footer><button class=\"resourceaction primary\" {{v16}}>{{v17}}<span>Check files</span></button></div>\n      </div></section></div>",
