	"请先将 CloudDrive2 或 OpenList 中的网盘挂载为本机文件夹；Windows 读取 NAS 共享时，请先映射为盘符，再选择对应文件夹。本机安装提示仅适用于在本机运行 CloudDrive。文件操作需要挂载工具和网盘账号授予写入权限；光鸭云盘的上传、建文件夹、改名和移动需要 CloudDrive2 v1.1.0 或更高版本，删除和复制暂不支持。": "First mount your cloud drive as a local folder using CloudDrive2 or OpenList. To access a NAS share on Windows, map it to a drive letter before selecting its folder. Local installation notices apply only when CloudDrive runs on this computer. File operations require write permission from both the mounting tool and the cloud account. Uploading, creating folders, renaming, and moving files on 光鸭云盘 require CloudDrive2 v1.1.0 or later; deleting and copying are not yet supported.",
	"其他设备打开这个地址时要加上上面的端口，例如 http://peach.local:8900。首次连接请允许 Windows 专用网络访问。": "Other devices must include the port shown above when opening this address, for example http://peach.local:8900. On the first connection, allow access on Windows private networks.",
